  "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 4\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nGiven the matrices above, write the following expression as a Hadamard product. Here $(\\,\\cdot \\,)$ denotes matrix multiplication.\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\">$(AB)\\cdot (By)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">\n\n{{field-1}}\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25px\" align=\"center\">$⊙$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n\n$-1$\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr> \n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">\n\n$4$\n\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n\n{{field-2}}\n\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
